[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2892202\">7040H70</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the intermediate linkage bolt.</p><p>2. Undo the nut.</p><p>3. Remove the seat belt.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035879.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the seat belt is\nundamaged.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>If the seat belt has been subjected\nto great stress, e.g. following an accident, it must be replaced\nas a complete unit together with its anchorages and the retaining\nbolts. Even if the seat belt does not show signs of visible defects,\nit may have lost its strength properties.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>1. Fit the seat belt winder.</p><p>2. Tighten the nut to the specified torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>CENTRE REAR SEAT BELT REEL.</p></td><td><p>M10 x 1.25</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>40</p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Tighten the bolt to the specified torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>CENTRE REAR SEAT BELT IDLER.</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>40</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2892202\">7040H70</a>\n                                           .</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035880.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]]